WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:08.720
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a Sci-fi comedy film called “Giohazard.”&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:18.080
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
The opening scene of the movie shows us an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:22.960
advertisement for the “beautiful girl pill”.&nbsp;
The advertisement claims that the pill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.960
is one of a kind medicine that will&nbsp;
reorganize women’s brain nerves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:32.880
and genes, turning them into the most beautiful&nbsp;
versions of themselves. For the first year, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:39.040
beautiful girl pill is sold out everywhere because&nbsp;
of its popularity and effectiveness. Any girl who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:45.360
takes it instantly experiences a change in their&nbsp;
body and face structure. Suffice to say, that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:51.600
pill is very successful, if not revolutionary.&nbsp;
However, in less than two years of use, women&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:57.280
begin to feel the side effects of the drug. 
Some get severe allergic reactions while others&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:02.960
go brain dead within seconds. On inspection,&nbsp;
it is found that the pill has directly affected&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:08.720
most of the women’s brains, making their&nbsp;
frontal lobe smaller in size. Because of this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:15.280
they show confusion and difficulty in doing the&nbsp;
easiest tasks. In addition, they turn emotionally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:21.200
insatiable and their sense of pain and pleasure&nbsp;
vanishes. The effects of the drug on the human&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:27.120
brain and their genes are far worse than what the&nbsp;
scientists had expected while creating the pill.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:32.240
Soon, experts find out that the pill has given&nbsp;
rise to a virus called the “beautiful girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.240 --> 00:01:39.040
virus” that is extremely contagious. The virus is&nbsp;
airborne but can only transfer through an infected&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:44.720
person’s kiss. Any woman infected by it turns&nbsp;
into a zombie-like creature with an instinct to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:50.640
kiss every man in their way. But the worst part&nbsp;
is that every man who gets kissed, gets infected&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:56.160
and entirely transforms into a woman. 
The protagonist of the movie is a young man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:02.240
named Qiao Ke. As the virus spreads rapidly&nbsp;
throughout China, Qiao Ke and his friend discuss&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:07.040
what they should do next. They receive a text&nbsp;
from Qiao Ke’s father and rush home to find a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:12.400
girl tied in the living room. The father says that&nbsp;
the girl is Qiao Ke’s brother who has converted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:18.080
into a woman because of the virus. Qiao Ke doesn’t&nbsp;
believe it and tries to check the girl’s body but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:24.480
the father claims that he has already checked and&nbsp;
confirmed that it is a girl. The girl was trying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:30.240
to kiss the father so he tied her to the chair.&nbsp;
Qiao Ke’s friend says that if the infected kisses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:36.000
them on any part of their body, the virus will&nbsp;
spread. Suddenly, the father feels a sharp pain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:41.920
in his chest. They find out that Qiao Ke’s brother&nbsp;
has accidentally kissed the father on his arm. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:47.280
father falls unconscious but just when they think&nbsp;
he is dead, he turns into a beautiful woman. 
&nbsp;

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:56.800
The newly formed girl tries to kiss Qiao Ke and&nbsp;
has to be restrained by his friend. The two accept&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.800 --> 00:03:02.560
the fact that Qiao Ke’s family is dead and the&nbsp;
women sitting in front of them are zombies. Hence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:07.920
they leave them alone and run outside. However,&nbsp;
they are chased by an infected woman before they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:13.360
can get inside the car. They get to the streets&nbsp;
but it is too late as the virus has now spread&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:18.960
beyond control. The streets are filled with women&nbsp;
who kiss all men in their sight. They try to go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:24.160
to the police but they have also been infected.&nbsp;
Soon, their phone signals are cut off and they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:29.920
cannot call anyone for help. The two get stuck&nbsp;
on the side of the street surrounded by women.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:33.680
Qiao Ke notices that the infected&nbsp;
do not attack beautiful women,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:39.680
so he suggests they get to the nearest clothing&nbsp;
store inside a mall and disguise themselves. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:45.280
since they are surrounded, Qiao Ke’s friend offers&nbsp;
to distract the girls and sacrifice himself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:52.560
He claims that there is no better way of dying&nbsp;
than being kissed by multiple women. Moreover,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:57.040
he has never fallen in love so this might be&nbsp;
his only chance to ever get with someone.
&nbsp;

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:05.200
Having said that, the guy jumps in plain view&nbsp;
attracting the infected ones. The girls kiss him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:10.720
as Qiao Ke runs away to the mall. Fortunately&nbsp;
for him, the mall is completely empty and so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:15.840
is the clothing store. He sits down on the&nbsp;
couch to take a rest and the time fast forwards&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:22.000
to a year later. Qiao Ke still lives in the store&nbsp;
which is now trashed. The beautiful girl virus has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:27.200
taken over China and according to the radio, the&nbsp;
survivors have formed camps in different parts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:32.720
of the country. Qiao Ke, however, lives alone in&nbsp;
the store. He dresses up in women’s clothing and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:38.480
wears a wig to go out and collect food supplies&nbsp;
once in a while. During one of such ventures, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:44.160
enters a car to check for supplies, only to find&nbsp;
a woman in the backseat. Trying to save his life,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:49.760
he quickly runs away but an infected woman follows&nbsp;
him to the store. While he checks the supplies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:54.640
she attacks him from behind but Qiao Ke is&nbsp;
saved by a stranger at the right time. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:59.280
stranger has a girl with him, who surprisingly&nbsp;
doesn’t attack them. It turns out that she is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:04.960
infected by the virus but her body hasn’t mutated&nbsp;
into a zombie, meaning that she is immune.
&nbsp;

00:05:04.960 --> 00:05:11.840
The man introduces himself as Li Wei and the girl&nbsp;
as Xiaoqi. Li Wei is a member of a survival camp&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:17.200
and is on the search for survivors. On his&nbsp;
journey, he found Xiaoqi and rescued her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:21.680
Since she is the only woman in China who is&nbsp;
immune, he is taking her to a place called the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:26.400
tower where a group of scientists has been trying&nbsp;
to find a cure for the beautiful girl virus.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:33.760
Xiaoqi is an asset to humanity who can stop the&nbsp;
pandemic. Li Wei invites Qiao Ke to the survivor’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:38.800
camp because it is way safer than staying at the&nbsp;
mall. The three then go to the parking lot where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:44.400
Qiao Ke had parked his car a year ago. He tries&nbsp;
to restart it as Li Wei guards them against the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:50.160
infected. Soon the car starts and they make their&nbsp;
way to the survivor’s camp. Unknown to them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:55.920
a man dressed as a woman follows them on a bike.&nbsp;
He is a spy from a rival camp that robs and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.920 --> 00:06:01.600
steals the supplies from the other camps. 
When they get to the base, Li Wei makes Xiaoqi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:07.280
wear a device to her mouth so the men would feel&nbsp;
safe around her. Even though she is immune, she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:13.280
still has the virus in her body, meaning that her&nbsp;
kiss is deady. When Qiao Ke is alone with Li Wei,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:19.040
he modifies the mouth device so she could open it&nbsp;
by herself. Then, the duo meets the investigation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:24.400
corps, a group formed by the most courageous&nbsp;
men who go into the city to collect supplies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:29.840
Their leader is Li Wei, who is now dressed as a&nbsp;
woman. They plan to take Xiaoqi to the tower and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:35.840
ask Qiao Ke to stay safely at the camp. Xiaoqi,&nbsp;
along with the investigation corp leave for a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:41.040
convenience store nearby to collect supplies for&nbsp;
their journey. Back at the camp, Qiao Ke finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:47.280
the rival spy giving information about Xiaoqi to&nbsp;
his camp. He senses that Xiaoqi and the others&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:53.120
are in danger and goes to save them. Meanwhile,&nbsp;
the investigation corp and Xiaoqi are attacked by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:58.960
the rival camp. They hold Xiaoqi hostage but the&nbsp;
sniper from the investigation corp fires at them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:04.400
starting a shootout. Qiao Ke arrives at the right&nbsp;
moment and brings Xiaoqi to a safer place. 
&nbsp;

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:09.760
The shootout gets intense and most of the members&nbsp;
of the investigation corp are killed. The only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:16.000
survivors left are Qiao Ke, Li Wei, and Xiaoqi.&nbsp;
But before they can flee from the site, the rival&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:22.000
group catches them. The leader makes Xiaoqi wear&nbsp;
the mouth device to be safe and plans to use her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:27.040
for his benefit. But his plans are ruined when&nbsp;
she takes off the device easily thanks to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:33.200
modification Qiao Ke made earlier. She then kisses&nbsp;
the leader. As he falls to the ground and starts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:38.800
transforming into a woman, his teammates run away&nbsp;
fearing the same fate. The surviving three go to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:44.320
their vehicle which is now surrounded by infected&nbsp;
women. Li Wei offers to get rid of them since he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:49.840
is still dressed as a girl. He kills all of them&nbsp;
and the three continue to drive to the tower.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:54.800
When they drive for some minutes, Li Wei asks&nbsp;
to get off the vehicle revealing that he, too,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.800 --> 00:08:00.880
has been kissed. Qiao Ke promises to get Xiaoqi&nbsp;
to the tower and says goodbye to Li Wei. 
&nbsp;

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:06.720
At night the duo stops to rest in a secluded&nbsp;
area. They sit in front of the fire and drink.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:12.560
Xiaoqi talks about her fiance who was killed a&nbsp;
year ago when the virus first started spreading.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.560 --> 00:08:17.760
It turns out that she kissed him, unknown&nbsp;
that she was infected. Qiao Ke comforts her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:25.440
and kisses her hand. The following day they&nbsp;
finally reach the tower but are disappointed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:30.320
when they see no one around. The duo assumes&nbsp;
that the tower was attacked by the infected.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:35.440
As they brainstorm what they should do next, a&nbsp;
group of infected women attack them. To their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:40.640
surprise, they are saved by men from inside a&nbsp;
nearby factory. It turns out that the tower is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.640 --> 00:08:46.160
actually an old factory where a group of soldiers&nbsp;
and scientists have gathered to find the cure.
&nbsp;

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:52.240
The leader of the tower, Xiao Cheng welcomes them&nbsp;
and introduces them to his right-hand man, Big P.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.640 --> 00:09:01.520
They take Xiaoqi’s blood samples for further&nbsp;
research. She then goes to her room to take a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:06.880
rest while Xiao Cheng shows Qiao Ke around the&nbsp;
facility. He is first taken to the lab where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:12.480
doctor Hou is looking at some blood samples. Hou&nbsp;
is an alcoholic who has a habit of forgetting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:18.000
things but he is the best of the researchers they&nbsp;
have. Then, Qiao Ke is taken to the part of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:22.800
lab where the infected girls are being kept&nbsp;
so the doctors can study them. But the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:28.160
surprising part about the facility is the room&nbsp;
where infants are kept. Xiao Cheng claims that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:33.760
babies were rescued recently, so Qiao Ke doesn’t&nbsp;
think much of it. At night, everyone gathers for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:39.680
dinner. Doctor Hou gets drunk and reveals that to&nbsp;
create an antidote, a chemical must be extracted&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:45.760
from Xiaoqi’s brain, and upon extraction,&nbsp;
she will die instantly. Even after that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:51.680
the antidote won’t be enough to save humanity. 
Qiao Ke looks at Xiao Cheng in confusion and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:58.080
senses that he knows everything. He quickly&nbsp;
pushes Xiao Cheng aside and runs away with Xiaoqi.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:03.040
Xiao Cheng, Big P, and the other men follow&nbsp;
them behind. Xiaoqi accidentally enters a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:08.960
room and finds non-infected women inside. It&nbsp;
turns out that Xiaoqi isn’t the only one who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:15.360
wasn’t infected by the virus. But before they&nbsp;
can inquire further, Big P knocks Qiao Ke out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:20.400
When he regains consciousness he is told that the&nbsp;
women who are immune to the virus are called the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:26.440
wisdom species. They have a rare chemical in their&nbsp;
brains that will help to make the antidote. Xiao&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:32.240
Cheng plans to use them to study the virus and to&nbsp;
create a vaccine to end the pandemic. Although his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:37.920
motive is good, he plans to kill the women for&nbsp;
something that isn’t even guaranteed. Moreover,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:43.680
he forcefully made his men mate with the captured&nbsp;
wisdom species to give birth to the babies that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:48.720
Qiao Ke saw earlier. When the women die, he&nbsp;
plans to use the babies for the antidote because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:53.360
they also belong to the wisdom species. 
Qiao Ke accepts to help Xiao Cheng with his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:58.880
plan for the sake of humanity but asks to&nbsp;
meet Xiaoqi for the last time. He meets her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:04.080
and tells her about his decision to help Xiao&nbsp;
Cheng. Xiaoqi looks at him in disappointment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:09.360
but before leaving, Qiao Ke tells Xiao Cheng to&nbsp;
make the women wear his mouth device when they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:14.400
are brought outside for surgery. Xiaoqi gets the&nbsp;
hint and explains to all the girls how they can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:19.360
take off the mouth device on their own. The next&nbsp;
day, the girls are made to wear pretty dresses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:24.400
and are brought to the operation room. They are&nbsp;
also made to wear mouth devices that Qiao Ke has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:30.800
secretly modified. As the operation starts, they&nbsp;
take the devices off and kiss all the doctors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:36.080
infecting them. Meanwhile, Qiao Ke goes to&nbsp;
the area where the infected women are kept and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:42.240
frees them so they can attack Xiao Cheng’s men.&nbsp;
Their plan works and the girls are finally free.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.240 --> 00:11:46.560
They get their kids and run away from the&nbsp;
factory with Xiaoqi while Qiao Ke stays&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:50.960
to announce the tower’s truth to the&nbsp;
survivors around China through radio. 
&nbsp;

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:56.640
He is soon attacked by Xiao Cheng and the two&nbsp;
get into a fight. Xiao Cheng is about to kill him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.640 --> 00:12:02.640
but Xiaoqi arrives at the right time and&nbsp;
saves Qiao Ke. However, during the struggle,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:09.280
Xiaoqi is stabbed. At last, Xiaoqi and Qiao&nbsp;
Ke announce the tower’s truth to the survivors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:14.160
through the radio. They know that there is&nbsp;
no chance for Xiaoqi to survive the injury&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:21.200
but Quao Ke refuses to let her die alone. At last,&nbsp;
they join two wires creating an explosion to blow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:27.600
up the facility and sacrificing themselves in the&nbsp;
process. Outside, the surviving wisdom species&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:33.360
watch the place burn with their babies. The movie&nbsp;
ends as they walk away determined to end the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:37.840
pandemic with their acquired knowledge. 
